        \end{array}} \\
         & = & {x_{2}\mathbf{u} + x_{4}\mathbf{v} + x_{5}\mathbf{w}}
        \end{array}$$

statement.paragraph:
Let $\textbf{v}_{1} = \,\,\left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
        2 \\
